      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presented in excellent condition throughout this 115sqm owner occupied four bedroom semi-detached property has a lot to offer with its energy efficient A3 rating. This well maintained home also has the benefit of an air to water heating system and boasts a double driveway to the front and a low maintenance rear garden together with a cladded garage. Current accommodation comprises of entrance hall, spacious sitting room, kitchen dining room, three double bedrooms, master en-suite, one single bedroom and family bathroom. Offering comfortable living throughout this property would make an ideal first time home or investment opportunity. Located along the N17 this property is ideal for commuting and is within minutes? drive of Ballymote, Collooney and only 15 minute drive to Sligo. Full details and viewings on request.\n\nThis property has an impressive A3 rating.\nAir to water heating system.\nPVc windows and doors.\nSteel cladded garden shed.\nMains water and sewer.\nOnly 30 mins drive from Ireland West Airport.\nTarmac driveway.\nConcrete post/timber panel boundary fence.\n"
